<===> complex/input.scss
a b {
  a: b;
}
c {
  @extend a b;
}

<===> complex/error
Error: complex selectors may not be extended.
  ,
5 |   @extend a b;
  |           ^^^
  '
  input.scss 5:11  root stylesheet

