================================================================================
<===> compound/input.scss
a:hover {
  a: b;
}
b {
  @extend a:hover;
}

<===> compound/error
Error: compound selectors may no longer be extended.
Consider `@extend a, :hover` instead.
See https://sass-lang.com/d/extend-compound for details.

  ,
5 |   @extend a:hover;
  |           ^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 5:11  root stylesheet

