================================================================================
<===> cross_media/before/both_in_media/input.scss
@media screen {
  a {@extend b}
}

@media print {
  b {c: d}
}

<===> cross_media/before/both_in_media/error
Error: You may not @extend selectors across media queries.
    ,
1   | @media screen {
    |        ====== extension @media
2   |   a {@extend b}
    |      ^^^^^^^^^ extension
... |
5   | @media print {
    |        ===== extended selector @media
6   |   b {c: d}
    |   = extended selector
    '
  input.scss 2:6  root stylesheet

