<===> cross_media/after/both_in_media/input.scss
@media print {
  a {b: c}
}

@media screen {
  d {@extend a}
}

<===> cross_media/after/both_in_media/error
Error: You may not @extend selectors across media queries.
    ,
1   | @media print {
    |        ===== extended selector @media
2   |   a {b: c}
    |   = extended selector
... |
5   | @media screen {
    |        ====== extension @media
6   |   d {@extend a}
    |      ^^^^^^^^^ extension
    '
  input.scss 6:6  root stylesheet

