<===> cross_media/merged/input.scss
@media screen {
  a {@extend b !optional}
}

@media print {
  a {@extend b !optional}
}

<===> cross_media/merged/error
Error: You may not @extend the same selector from within different media queries.
    ,
1   | @media screen {
    |        ====== first extension @media
2   |   a {@extend b !optional}
    |      =================== first extension
... |
5   | @media print {
    |        ===== second extension @media
6   |   a {@extend b !optional}
    |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ second extension
    '
  input.scss 6:6  root stylesheet
